{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Let the labor be heavy.</b> They were punished for this measure for measure, as it is written (Exodus 14:25): ״וינהגהו בכבדות״, and likewise for the expression ״לכו קחו לכם תבן״ they were punished, as it is written (ibid.): ״ויולך ה׳ את הים״, and likewise for the expression ״ויפץ העם״ they were punished, as it is written (Jeremiah 18:17): ״כרוח קדים אפיצם״, that they were scattered in the sea, and likewise for ״לקושש קש לתבן״ they were punished, as it is written (Exodus 15:7): ״יאכלמו כקש״, and what it says, ״ואל ישעו בדברי שקר״ — its Targum is בפתגמין בטלין, and he means to say thus regarding the words of Moses and Aaron, who were promising them redemption."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:56:21.004736884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}